Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： 漫游字幕组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕由kewenyu重新製作以適應重製版
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.25,0:00:04.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,同樣的中繼殖民地還有3個
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:07.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,已全部壓制 未引起混亂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.53,0:00:10.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼說總共5個嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.87,0:00:13.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,難以置信 真是不可原諒的疏忽
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.91,0:00:14.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.98,0:00:15.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,的確
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.35,0:00:20.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,敵人也很高明 但看來我們也太過關注地面
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.17,0:00:24.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,把他們都集中到月球軌道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.65,0:00:26.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,處分稍後再作打算
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.56,0:00:27.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.62,0:00:29.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Daedalus基地呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.58,0:00:33.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,按您的指示 已安排羅蘭隊前往
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.21,0:00:36.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,應該已經到達了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.14,0:00:38.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎 謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.13,0:00:42.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼可以讓Minerva和月球艦隊休息了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.52,0:00:46.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他們連續作戰應該都累壞了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.54,0:00:47.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.89,0:00:50.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過真是幹得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.31,0:00:53.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,月球艦隊如此 Minerva更是出色
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.19,0:00:56.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 多虧他們或許真能結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.31,0:01:03.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也有報告說這次終於剷除了再次逃亡的吉普利爾
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.75,0:01:09.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然有情報說大西洋聯邦總統還在Arzachel
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.85,0:01:12.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但已無法控制軍隊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.70,0:01:13.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.45,0:01:17.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過我們也真是愚蠢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.74,0:01:18.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.91,0:01:22.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,心存僥倖的安逸心理將會招致巨大的危機
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.59,0:01:26.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,應該早就充分認識到的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.36,0:01:30.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次又未能防範於未然
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.97,0:01:34.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,實在慚愧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.96,0:01:37.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 並不是在責備你們
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.96,0:01:40.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不得不謝罪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.15,0:01:43.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,向犧牲的眾多生命
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.75,0:01:46.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但想到這點
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.35,0:01:51.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次一定要創造出絕不會再重演這種慘劇的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.43,0:01:56.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,作為對逝去的人們最低限度的補償吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.94,0:01:57.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.97,0:02:22.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼 怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.00,0:02:24.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼怎麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.90,0:02:28.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,難得能休息了 為什麼突然進行射擊訓練
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.05,0:02:31.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我已經睡過了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.98,0:02:33.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷說要做的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.80,0:02:34.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.92,0:02:37.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 等等啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.50,0:02:38.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,露娜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.36,0:02:42.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,露娜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.43,0:02:44.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,露娜 生什麼氣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.18,0:02:46.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒生什麼氣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.70,0:02:48.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在生氣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.38,0:02:51.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.27,0:02:54.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別這樣 莫名其妙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.67,0:03:00.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只是有點話想說
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.14,0:03:02.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那時候太倉促
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.15,0:03:06.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭 和梅琳的事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.34,0:03:15.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過 算了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.37,0:03:20.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,想說的 只是要你別介意
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.80,0:03:27.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然想到他們可能還活著 我也無法保持冷靜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.80,0:03:30.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是真沒有錯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.29,0:03:30.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,露娜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.91,0:03:33.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也知道那是命令
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.07,0:03:36.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而且無法排除嫌疑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.84,0:03:40.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以想叫你別介意 如此而已
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.43,0:03:42.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.88,0:03:44.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,露娜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,空は飛べないけれど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,翼ならあるのさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,慰めながら、不謹慎だけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,泣いてる顔も綺麗で焦るよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,くじけず夢を見ることは
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,自分と戦ってること
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,日ごとに増える擦り傷を
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,自慢してもいいくらいさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,空は飛べないけれど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,翼ならあげよう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,それはもう一人じゃないと
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,君の孤独剥がす言葉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,どんなペシミストも
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,恋をして変わる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,選んだ道がもし行き止まりなら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,そこで迷えばいい
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.29,0:05:44.09,title SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}{\blur4}真实之歌
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.49,0:05:41.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,進入角度良好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.69,0:05:42.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,通路正常
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.09,0:05:45.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Archangel進入8號地點
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.45,0:05:47.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是Archangel 了解
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.56,0:05:49.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,進入8號地點
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.60,0:05:54.47,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,700)}{\fad(500,500)}{\blur3}月面都市 哥白尼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.45,0:06:02.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那打敗我的Impulse駕駛員
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.69,0:06:04.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也是那個叫真的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.35,0:06:06.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.95,0:06:08.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他現在駕駛Destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.74,0:06:10.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.07,0:06:14.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過 那時候說實話真嚇了一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.40,0:06:18.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒想到你會被真幹掉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.14,0:06:23.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,當時我也在猶豫是否該和ZAFT作戰
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.57,0:06:27.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉也在 總想盡力逃走
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.30,0:06:31.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Archangel也被打中 真是嚇了一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.12,0:06:36.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 或許正因此而明白
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.84,0:06:38.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這不對勁
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.03,0:06:39.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.79,0:06:42.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長和雷的棘手之處就在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.92,0:06:47.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,交談起來確實覺得他們說的都對
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.82,0:06:48.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.41,0:06:52.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這我明白 實際上也是對的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.27,0:06:57.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真也…恐怕無法脫離這點
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.86,0:07:02.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為他也是個為夢想努力的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.33,0:07:07.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.94,0:07:56.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請不要被她的形象所迷惑
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.59,0:07:59.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我是拉克絲 克萊茵
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.71,0:08:06.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼 不用擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.67,0:08:11.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你暫時藏身起來較好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.10,0:08:14.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對不會虧待妳
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.80,0:08:16.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,感謝你的努力
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.90,0:08:20.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 因為我…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.03,0:08:22.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那全都是我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.21,0:08:25.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是那個人 是我做的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.91,0:08:33.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但就算你也無法一直這樣做下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.12,0:08:36.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣的話 你遲早也會被殺
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.36,0:08:41.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這不可能 這種事…絕對
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.88,0:08:42.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.06,0:08:47.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,茶泡好了 請
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.41,0:08:54.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請問
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.31,0:08:55.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.50,0:08:57.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長還沒有任何消息?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.53,0:09:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是 很遺憾
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.26,0:09:06.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過沒辦法 現在PLANT確實出了大事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.24,0:09:09.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這拉克絲小姐也很清楚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.65,0:09:12.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.69,0:09:15.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這我知道 但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.08,0:09:21.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在確實形勢複雜
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.58,0:09:27.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這哥白尼也是 據說Archangel剛剛入港呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.33,0:09:29.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Archangel?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.70,0:09:32.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 怎麼回事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.96,0:09:35.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這種時候登上月球
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.52,0:09:40.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那個人是不是也一起呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.09,0:09:48.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就是 在奧布說自己和Archangel一起的那個人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.54,0:09:50.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.50,0:09:55.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,很傷腦筋呢 那個人也真是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.92,0:10:00.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那樣議長的努力都白費了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.13,0:10:03.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼要那麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.33,0:10:07.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲小姐其實並不是那種人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.12,0:10:12.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲小姐總是熱愛和平
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.69,0:10:18.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但在需要的時候總會引導我們 身先士卒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.41,0:10:20.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,她是這樣的人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.08,0:10:24.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我們才會跟隨她
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.09,0:10:28.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是這樣的拉克絲小姐 就是騙人的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.04,0:10:30.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,騙人?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.00,0:10:36.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我認為自從開戰以來 一直在議長身邊努力的人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.41,0:10:38.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,才是真正的拉克絲小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.38,0:10:40.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.44,0:10:43.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請叫我莎拉 拉克絲小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.62,0:10:45.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我會協助您
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.13,0:10:49.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在不這樣大家都會困擾
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.74,0:10:53.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯吧 拉克絲小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.09,0:11:00.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,來 喝茶吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.22,0:11:03.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,再談談吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.30,0:11:06.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一定會想出好主意的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.19,0:11:19.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很久沒有外出了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.79,0:11:22.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,已經在艦內過了幾個月
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.40,0:11:24.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.87,0:11:27.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 前不久一直在宇宙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.33,0:11:29.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,再往前是海底
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.68,0:11:35.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然明白這是事出無奈
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.54,0:11:36.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但難免有點…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.13,0:11:37.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.65,0:11:39.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.04,0:11:48.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那我們走了 拉米亞斯艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.25,0:11:51.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 不過要小心
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.19,0:11:52.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.12,0:11:56.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣真的好嗎 只讓他們去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.09,0:12:00.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的 只是去市內
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.04,0:12:02.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,保鏢也很可靠
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.98,0:12:05.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不是說這事 是說妳
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.25,0:12:11.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,想出去呼吸新鮮空氣的話我很樂意奉陪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.72,0:12:15.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一直在船裡也不好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.40,0:12:17.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,責任又那麼重
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.24,0:12:23.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝 不過沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.31,0:12:25.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我留在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.46,0:12:29.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那總之先從艦內護衛做起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.73,0:12:33.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一起…去洗個澡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.02,0:12:35.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,啊　我說…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.39,0:12:38.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你果然不是同一個人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.10,0:12:40.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.14,0:12:55.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我是第一次來哥白尼 你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.61,0:12:57.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是 我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.55,0:13:06.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別這麼生氣 阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.05,0:13:08.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒在生氣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.94,0:13:10.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只是有點吃驚
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.86,0:13:11.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是一回事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.06,0:13:15.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我說你 拉克絲她…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.37,0:13:16.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.26,0:13:18.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.22,0:13:20.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.10,0:13:23.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的 阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.53,0:13:26.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我和拉克絲都是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.70,0:13:30.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以不用再一個人拼命了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.65,0:13:33.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.62,0:13:38.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼樣 基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.41,0:13:40.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.34,0:13:42.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這件怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.88,0:13:44.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我覺得挺好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.31,0:13:47.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,看來根本無所謂
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.58,0:13:50.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是這個意思
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.21,0:14:00.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是米亞的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.92,0:14:07.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,救命 我會被殺 拉克絲小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.06,0:14:15.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,第一感覺 像是陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.19,0:14:19.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯　但也不能放任不管
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.01,0:14:22.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 利用這點設計
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.55,0:14:24.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,她是?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.52,0:14:26.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對  米亞 坎貝爾
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.21,0:14:28.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就是議長的拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.63,0:14:36.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你保護拉克絲馬上回船上
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.54,0:14:39.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我找增援 稍等
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.07,0:14:41.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道目的是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.30,0:14:43.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.18,0:14:45.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,啊?　別說傻…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.80,0:14:48.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,她呼喚的是我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.10,0:14:49.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.12,0:14:53.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,總有一天必須這樣做
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.45,0:14:55.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是吧 基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.17,0:14:58.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.28,0:15:02.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我想去見她
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.39,0:15:06.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了 總之先和船上聯繫
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.14,0:15:07.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我說你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.14,0:15:11.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的阿斯蘭 我也知道是陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.75,0:15:14.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還有大家在 是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.25,0:15:17.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝 基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.92,0:15:19.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不用 不過要當心
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.02,0:15:39.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,米亞
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.92,0:15:43.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭? 阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.37,0:15:48.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那個傻瓜 說了把他引到舞台上的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.57,0:15:51.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭 你還活著
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.58,0:15:52.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,停下來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.57,0:15:54.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.86,0:15:56.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,信息我收到了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.08,0:15:58.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也知道是陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.67,0:16:01.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但這是最後的機會 米亞
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.90,0:16:03.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才來
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.78,0:16:06.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.76,0:16:09.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.52,0:16:12.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,妳好 米亞
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.36,0:16:14.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,初次見面
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.75,0:16:22.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,信上寫著求救 不然會被殺
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.25,0:16:26.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那就和我一起來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.98,0:16:35.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我 是我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.88,0:16:37.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,米亞
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.47,0:16:41.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲小姐其實並不是那種人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.53,0:16:45.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是這樣的拉克絲小姐 就是騙人的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.68,0:16:49.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,托妳的福世界真的得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.39,0:16:51.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我和群眾也是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.41,0:16:54.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這點絕不會忘記
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.89,0:16:55.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,米亞　冷靜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.61,0:16:58.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的　所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.32,0:17:00.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我才是拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.17,0:17:03.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.03,0:17:06.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,聲音和臉都一模一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.51,0:17:10.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我是拉克絲 有什麼不好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.53,0:17:16.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,米亞　夠了　妳...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.06,0:17:19.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,想得到名字的話讓給妳
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.40,0:17:21.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還有模樣
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.89,0:17:26.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但即使如此 妳和我也是不同的人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.59,0:17:28.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這不會改變
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.08,0:17:43.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們誰都無法成為自己以外的任何人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.71,0:17:49.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過 正因如此才有妳我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.63,0:17:51.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,身在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.72,0:17:55.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 能夠邂逅
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.47,0:17:58.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和他人 甚至和自己
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.72,0:18:03.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,妳的夢想是妳的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.74,0:18:07.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請為此而歌唱 為了自己
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.67,0:18:11.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,夢想不能為他人所用
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.24,0:18:19.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.74,0:18:34.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉 這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.56,0:18:45.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,多少人 知道嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.96,0:18:47.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道 是莎拉她...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.62,0:19:02.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,米亞
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.50,0:19:08.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的 對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.95,0:19:21.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,跑起來
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.19,0:19:42.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 什麼情況
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.71,0:19:52.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧 孩子們
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.52,0:19:54.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,太慢了 穆先生
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.24,0:19:55.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.17,0:19:57.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,快保護拉克絲她們
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.77,0:19:59.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 明白
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.36,0:20:01.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.53,0:20:02.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 總算
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.07,0:20:05.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真的一直給妳添麻煩 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.08,0:20:08.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.15,0:20:10.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,來　小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.41,0:20:18.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,妳也來
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.40,0:20:27.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,危險
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.71,0:20:44.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,米亞
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.05,0:20:49.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,米亞 米亞
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.11,0:21:02.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我的歌…和生命　請千萬別忘記
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.34,0:21:08.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,爽朗溫柔的笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.80,0:21:09.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是妳?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.58,0:21:13.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,米亞
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.23,0:21:22.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,有點想和大家再見一面
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.52,0:21:23.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,米亞
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.20,0:21:25.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,快點送她到Archangel　穆先生
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.79,0:21:29.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.95,0:21:31.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,米亞
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.11,0:21:32.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,米亞
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.78,0:21:58.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,何も知らないほうが
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,幸せというけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕はきっと滿足しないはずだから
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕が選んだ今を生きたい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,それだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,君の速さは僕に似ている
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,齒止めのきかなくなる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,空が怖くなって
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕はいつまで頑張ればいいの
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,二人ならば終わらせることができる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.23,0:23:28.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,留下的只有一張照片和碟片
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.32,0:23:32.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無法欺騙的生命與思念的奇蹟
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.92,0:23:36.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,改變的事是夢嗎 無法改變的自己是真實的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.30,0:23:41.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲愁雲不展的眼眸正朝向最大的敵人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.43,0:23:45.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下集 機動戰士 GUNDAM SEED DESTINY
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.97,0:23:46.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,米亞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.64,0:23:50.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,面對惡夢的世界 Freedom
